      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "uZRu8",
      "text": "$\\quad V_{A B}=V_{B C}=50 \\mathrm{~V}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The equivalent circuit is shown in figure.\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\nV_{1}+V_{2}=100 \\\\\r\n\r\n\\text { and } 2 V_{1}=6 V_{2}\r\n\r\n\\end{array}\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/s2O76azAVpnq35rd4-HqwdGjim3m6EWgcmopPQHMzZQ.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\r\n\r\nOn solving above equations, we get $V_{1}=75 V, V_{2}=25 V$",
    "image": null
  },
